s resolve, 105 unique ids, no external refs). The background verifier may hit the same capture limit — the page itself renders normally in a browser.\nCreated 30 files\nHow did this design turn out?\nClaude Fable 5 draws down usage much faster than Opus 5.5.\n\n\n\n\nFable 5.1\nMax\nSend\nSuperagent Console UI\n100%\nComment\nEdit\nPresent\nShare\nG"
